  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "牛津是全球享有盛名的高等学府，其声望几乎让人无法企及。",
      "output_sha256": "ec29b437f323105e76d350c763208a3055272df9fa30970da96b68cdd357d142",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.335324,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f43065a83a99630d7dc385795589091c42724dff2a2372de482ace6838b8bac0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ec29b437f323105e76d350c763208a3055272df9fa30970da96b68cdd357d142",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "其成功的秘诀在于独特的导师制。",
      "output_sha256": "5e67e823049f5be2cea572a40861f2311ca367de8cdff3330128cbfb2293071a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.461301,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8bdf8d0643a3cb37e49e9bb3413dddb9494b3d8213365ffdc8779b444b9e2d90"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5e67e823049f5be2cea572a40861f2311ca367de8cdff3330128cbfb2293071a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "导师的秘密，按利卡克克教授说，是“对准了他的徒弟们抽烟”。",
      "output_sha256": "40465d44ec681f01801527ba8e933a42246012d81f22d7890dcc62a60c02eba0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "40465d44ec681f01801527ba8e933a42246012d81f22d7890dcc62a60c02eba0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "真的，在牛津或康桥地方要找一个不吸烟的学生是很费事的──先生更不用提。",
      "output_sha256": "ccc775d87d8cffd146957124104199e67607d6a59b3862e57f573a6ec075e745",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "ccc775d87d8cffd146957124104199e67607d6a59b3862e57f573a6ec075e745",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "学习吸烟、学习在沙发上以奇怪的姿势坐着、学习含糊其辞地交流——这就是大学教育的全部意义。",
      "output_sha256": "d17a0c55275fb8b59a25c383e39c422a99c496971583189b886bdc7997cad1ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.402774,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2c12470d93ab67c409ad1a37be2fa25721d3cde1795acb3ad7a4b49b7b53038c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d17a0c55275fb8b59a25c383e39c422a99c496971583189b886bdc7997cad1ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“牛津人”、“康桥人”：还不彀中吗？",
      "output_sha256": "dc652e702570007426f0b7e29b950d90511a042deb277bada3fd01d43bec0504",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "dc652e702570007426f0b7e29b950d90511a042deb277bada3fd01d43bec0504",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我如其有钱办学堂的话，利卡克说，第一件事情我要做的是造一间吸烟室，其次造宿舍，再次造图书室；真要到了有钱没地方花的时候再来造课堂。",
      "output_sha256": "0ef4e0645e18f65d5b90e9d8f262c6ad49782aa60c67403c05150ea99621d5de",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "0ef4e0645e18f65d5b90e9d8f262c6ad49782aa60c67403c05150ea99621d5de",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "怪不得有人就会说，原来英国学生就会吃烟，就会懒惰。",
      "output_sha256": "8af0352ee298903867f34b6c6c097632944b1cd848dda777e4d4543d842cc0dc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "8af0352ee298903867f34b6c6c097632944b1cd848dda777e4d4543d842cc0dc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "臭绅士的架子！",
      "output_sha256": "725d98d0360ce7512be91932c5386087951d8a9f20f970062521a161f6826bd0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "725d98d0360ce7512be91932c5386087951d8a9f20f970062521a161f6826bd0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "臭架子的绅士！",
      "output_sha256": "29389e0566a85dcc8c37fd4a8771f5870b47bc43c89f2668d3afcd526b12b46f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "29389e0566a85dcc8c37fd4a8771f5870b47bc43c89f2668d3afcd526b12b46f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "可见我们这一代人身上有些古怪的刺，原来有些人竟是受到了烟熏的影响，变成了所谓的“绅士”！",
      "output_sha256": "93c5b4f4260ab13f0ee07cbfe272d49ea75935c52ab5fc93afb62fdc693b05b3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.378161,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f61b7e56f5fc5ecb1eb18c6cbac6b8e2984b1a660e7e276ff987cb93ea862882"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "93c5b4f4260ab13f0ee07cbfe272d49ea75935c52ab5fc93afb62fdc693b05b3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这年头说话得谨慎些。",
      "output_sha256": "2261d78fcd4c726a999724279076c212399b10afdd6e556c2bd0d49335ee0260",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "2261d78fcd4c726a999724279076c212399b10afdd6e556c2bd0d49335ee0260",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "提起英国就犯嫌疑。",
      "output_sha256": "7fb8648369a38658fd6e81299274389cebe6bb88a6623739d21feaad3763631e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "7fb8648369a38658fd6e81299274389cebe6bb88a6623739d21feaad3763631e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "贵族主义！",
      "output_sha256": "5e019cbcc4c146297e496a48d4d74e8976a3333669d08a82928128817ced4060",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "5e019cbcc4c146297e496a48d4d74e8976a3333669d08a82928128817ced4060",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "帝国主义！",
      "output_sha256": "6b3e6f57c8e0d6dc029bb8b4b008c067c7cd42bdc0c22d4460ed83e42c2d4ae8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "6b3e6f57c8e0d6dc029bb8b4b008c067c7cd42bdc0c22d4460ed83e42c2d4ae8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "走狗！",
      "output_sha256": "d7c527358f17a16abec858923a1cf7807066da375b07cc56134b428c8a88398a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "d7c527358f17a16abec858923a1cf7807066da375b07cc56134b428c8a88398a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "挖个坑把它埋了！",
      "output_sha256": "859401f408c51effecdb6abe02843bc29cdd21e50fb0e95fbac3094eccc779c2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.655082,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5eb4e08194ea7d2856f8b3dadb29b76dc5f75185741e31f04f3fe1ea8e8b666a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "859401f408c51effecdb6abe02843bc29cdd21e50fb0e95fbac3094eccc779c2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "实际上事情可不这么简单。",
      "output_sha256": "9d5cd19cebacb90cc6bcaa34bb523cd451b23a8706f5dd15ce64e76af04f166d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "9d5cd19cebacb90cc6bcaa34bb523cd451b23a8706f5dd15ce64e76af04f166d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "侵略和压迫是值得谴责的，但我们不应将所有事物都混为一谈。",
      "output_sha256": "d59f4d254c188b01eff781a861b4eae8bd1d997598e969b0506947cf12b3caf6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.305788,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ef4fd0efdcd73be79a8fa919cae7a155f17c77e568b13823cf64b44ea974979e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d59f4d254c188b01eff781a861b4eae8bd1d997598e969b0506947cf12b3caf6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "至少我们得承认英国，就它本身说，是一个站得住的国家，英国人是有出息的民族。",
      "output_sha256": "b9ada1aa633a440d92b4f96372b526027f80b1bd0c55f198dba74e2a63d66dde",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "b9ada1aa633a440d92b4f96372b526027f80b1bd0c55f198dba74e2a63d66dde",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "它有着有序的生活和充满活力的文化。",
      "output_sha256": "efd7d05166eb9481b91a104704352a77704b4cc7925dd7b5c67ec9e5b6b72193",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.489013,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "878d0d4c8b8b305cb8cbd2de066d10e57cf59e2f1cee87a9761a070de54698ea"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "efd7d05166eb9481b91a104704352a77704b4cc7925dd7b5c67ec9e5b6b72193",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们也应当承认，牛津和剑桥至少是令人羡慕的学府，是英国文化生活的摇篮。",
      "output_sha256": "2a08be42591a7a6b7a11865af5af295df432e77c8fbe240daab546d114c69df3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.629766,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9b392401edcd62eba4abece478325eea2e65bf77241a2dfde6606fc854786952"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2a08be42591a7a6b7a11865af5af295df432e77c8fbe240daab546d114c69df3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "多少伟大的政治家、学者、诗人、艺术家和科学家，都是从这两所学府中走出来的——他们的灵感或许都与烟雾相伴。",
      "output_sha256": "421587625f421ee5f8b9c78ff00582df6114dbfa829f049b6c2cf0d2e79b70aa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.576504,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ae4802ac3d94ce7cad57edf9fbbf4a231a9ae89052a27172543baa12d8f64e76"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "421587625f421ee5f8b9c78ff00582df6114dbfa829f049b6c2cf0d2e79b70aa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "利卡克的话并非全是玩笑。",
      "output_sha256": "9255596ddf5acbf12e705970f436de0b7512910da268ac678f1d7f06c7e97b22",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.575996,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9089d2d93ad1f36bcc1b80b3eee6315085fc4101a0ee20eee87324c88ed80f11"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9255596ddf5acbf12e705970f436de0b7512910da268ac678f1d7f06c7e97b22",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“抽烟主义”是值得研究的。",
      "output_sha256": "9ff4497aac4dfe270356f7ec1f26912beb93d0908cd90e51f485779d7dd4488a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "9ff4497aac4dfe270356f7ec1f26912beb93d0908cd90e51f485779d7dd4488a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但吸烟室究竟是怎么一回事？",
      "output_sha256": "de0317fcfc5602eeed1ccce19a004e065f1f0ed85474820ba8a2857fa6247778",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "de0317fcfc5602eeed1ccce19a004e065f1f0ed85474820ba8a2857fa6247778",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "烟斗中如何能提炼出文化的真谛？",
      "output_sha256": "3a8d8b2d3b215f96e58afd0e800227e6d3a7c61ba5aaa93421010d78e603c2c1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.534524,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8389763d0d6c0247ed07720c7145b7b2b8a4bba46b0614d06b9a9bc1ba9da491"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3a8d8b2d3b215f96e58afd0e800227e6d3a7c61ba5aaa93421010d78e603c2c1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "学生抽烟为何成为英国教育的秘密？",
      "output_sha256": "d77468b3a813295282d3f4419f7433cab30884660e75437add9b0b212c53bcfb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.639417,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "18ab95a377da4a3f828a9c841501930560245f90220b8c0f1733bf57b8272193"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d77468b3a813295282d3f4419f7433cab30884660e75437add9b0b212c53bcfb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "利卡克先生没有描写牛津、康桥生活的真相；他只这么说，他不曾说出一个所以然来。",
      "output_sha256": "03dd29e4868d913d05b29b9e6ff7e7d56f0c4c4dff496d5a62686f092e328366",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "03dd29e4868d913d05b29b9e6ff7e7d56f0c4c4dff496d5a62686f092e328366",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "许有人愿意听听的，我想。",
      "output_sha256": "26ecb840ae603acae37465b5bcf0f4c99e592b9e4afa74a512d8b68927b1b9b0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "26ecb840ae603acae37465b5bcf0f4c99e592b9e4afa74a512d8b68927b1b9b0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我也叫名在英国念过两年书，大部分的时间在康桥。",
      "output_sha256": "772b1801e990de9f4afa2e30e36b8e57a40b37ffaed858feac3a0b76ef8deb7f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "772b1801e990de9f4afa2e30e36b8e57a40b37ffaed858feac3a0b76ef8deb7f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但严格的说，我还是不够资格的。",
      "output_sha256": "a31a26c9d5922e55d31fb8fa1eaffe7506bdf8547274cdcaf922d28ba0b0bfb4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "a31a26c9d5922e55d31fb8fa1eaffe7506bdf8547274cdcaf922d28ba0b0bfb4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我当初并不是像我的朋友温源宁先生似的出了大金镑正式去请教熏烟的：我只是个，比方说，烤小半熟的白薯，离着焦味儿透香还正远哪。",
      "output_sha256": "cb13b0ce92ac69d11fd84212c0be1fb1ab1819acd72b94178d9cdc9aad71adbc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "cb13b0ce92ac69d11fd84212c0be1fb1ab1819acd72b94178d9cdc9aad71adbc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但我在康桥的日子可真是享福，深怕这辈子再也得不到那样蜜甜的机会了。",
      "output_sha256": "16e7142a0cf277a5f9da380364868e0dbdd2555abf09e8b1117a9f3698c7cb16",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "16e7142a0cf277a5f9da380364868e0dbdd2555abf09e8b1117a9f3698c7cb16",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我不敢说剑桥给了我多少知识或教会了我什么。",
      "output_sha256": "530d5e76a382c103b71a5cbf21bf02876826527b3680bcda4c9a2e36120c8014",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.732647,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "86c8ce111e4872afc14f268434d3b1c5381bf0cda8b65103a69e511c3211a2ae"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "530d5e76a382c103b71a5cbf21bf02876826527b3680bcda4c9a2e36120c8014",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我不敢说受了康桥的洗礼，一个人就会变气息，脱凡胎。",
      "output_sha256": "a9e0362188b883e80d8eb5ac182e3c8911f86eac4479475f2e480c7558e60e5e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "a9e0362188b883e80d8eb5ac182e3c8911f86eac4479475f2e480c7558e60e5e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我敢说的只是──就我个人说，我的眼是康桥教我睁的，我的求知欲是康桥给我拨动的，我的自我的意识是康桥给我胚胎的。",
      "output_sha256": "82cfb58c145bf25c0962098099ade5c6e094322fcdec9aeb1050300680f56f39",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "82cfb58c145bf25c0962098099ade5c6e094322fcdec9aeb1050300680f56f39",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我在美国有整两年，在英国也算是整两年。",
      "output_sha256": "d72ec2150864d8daa4f6fa6f15bfe8cbf06a8e562cd6c69d10b5f1ffe4b630a1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "d72ec2150864d8daa4f6fa6f15bfe8cbf06a8e562cd6c69d10b5f1ffe4b630a1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在美国我忙的是上课，听讲，写考卷，龈橡皮糖，看电影，赌咒，在康桥我忙的是散步，划船，骑自转车，抽烟，闲谈，吃五点钟茶，牛油烤饼，看闲书。",
      "output_sha256": "d33a446f86691b4269d8384252994798084748843a76e310ebffac6df174932e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "d33a446f86691b4269d8384252994798084748843a76e310ebffac6df174932e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "如其我到美国的时候是一个不含糊的草包，我离开自由神的时候也还是那原封没有动；但如其我在美国时候不曾通窍，我在康桥的日子至少自己明白了原先只是一肚子颟顸。",
      "output_sha256": "114a0840bd1ddc61dc65ce140e9b4eb6778a8f3f966d2adc5c580a98f515dd9c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "114a0840bd1ddc61dc65ce140e9b4eb6778a8f3f966d2adc5c580a98f515dd9c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这种差别并不算小。",
      "output_sha256": "a106b071652731c86ecf70495459768d54717c7ba4c4d3e284c3896d1df2e6f0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.525,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "32c314506eb92c50fb51c84578a63111453f5a323d1361865cdf29f80edbe2fe"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a106b071652731c86ecf70495459768d54717c7ba4c4d3e284c3896d1df2e6f0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我一直想谈谈剑桥，对它怀有无限的柔情，但又害怕亵渎它而迟迟未能开口。",
      "output_sha256": "64b1d09e30a3c57f7b41070b07f6e3b8a6038b5b2c285f46804776223390fc10",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.547738,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        42,
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e3cf580c57781bdafd92b6345815d3e9052b0a96aa6095f2933f8132a316c7fd",
        "f44688c843ae39fe01bdac81516e66e94b95c32147ef7976e19bec5ff25adaf3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "64b1d09e30a3c57f7b41070b07f6e3b8a6038b5b2c285f46804776223390fc10",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如今，只要提到“贵族教育”这个口号，便能轻易抹去牛顿、达尔文、米尔顿、拜伦、华兹华斯、阿诺德、纽门、罗塞提、格兰斯顿等人的母校。",
      "output_sha256": "5c4014547b3c4484a9d4ae16d1581247251ba4a38f8950be157b20bd39f9db54",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.568069,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44,
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e7b2371900317e66706c3199d87f79ceb670b33659185817f7209039ea615de1",
        "ca8ed020abd168351f5ccd35326dac9cb706214c90e30efa6e5bb82a4d64798e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5c4014547b3c4484a9d4ae16d1581247251ba4a38f8950be157b20bd39f9db54",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "再说年来交通便利了，各式各种日新月异的教育原理教育新制翩翩的从各方向的外洋飞到中华，哪还容得厨房老过四百年墙壁上爬满骚胡髭一类藤萝的老书院一起来上讲坛？",
      "output_sha256": "c60bc9d89dc4bed45d538e48930db893af1e2c88bc87d47f3e3b5b6bbc1fd42d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "c60bc9d89dc4bed45d538e48930db893af1e2c88bc87d47f3e3b5b6bbc1fd42d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，若从另一个角度来看，我们也能看到一些有见地的人不再忍受国内高等教育的混乱，试图跳出这条破败的道路，另寻出路。",
      "output_sha256": "9695c0fd11f9c7e809ecc908308bf671612ae4c82268b6b253ee9f291b7e3aa0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.509874,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1db2c04a9b009e2fd42b261a97294c5ebd75541f14f5546a46a021bb0eaf1d2a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9695c0fd11f9c7e809ecc908308bf671612ae4c82268b6b253ee9f291b7e3aa0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "向外望去，牛津和剑桥的学院向你微笑；回头望去，五老峰下白鹿洞等书院又让你感到惆怅。",
      "output_sha256": "3e0ab2474bb6bed0992aff72942b2a5b4ad36052aab03b22f88ce06fed96469b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.579668,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "aa09364931055602d7a707d8bac6faaee83aa63381c07f062dce3bc540d410fe"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3e0ab2474bb6bed0992aff72942b2a5b4ad36052aab03b22f88ce06fed96469b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这浪漫的思乡病跟着现代教育丑化的程度在少数人的心中一天深似一天。",
      "output_sha256": "417430f6f7a4a795fecb28d19817c56d60ec99c7a330b20a54b6208a2a1da6f7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "417430f6f7a4a795fecb28d19817c56d60ec99c7a330b20a54b6208a2a1da6f7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这机械性、买卖性的教育够腻烦了，我们说。",
      "output_sha256": "d02cc5d2b0aec2dc61d91b70ddef49f1d8f2ea49adda3a4dab841d90ca67eab2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "d02cc5d2b0aec2dc61d91b70ddef49f1d8f2ea49adda3a4dab841d90ca67eab2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们也要几间满沿着爬山虎的高雪克屋子来安息我们的灵性，我们说。",
      "output_sha256": "d32425c3419b8a07df42fe920174bc388ea18149d2b9df3cd1f773be04e49804",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "d32425c3419b8a07df42fe920174bc388ea18149d2b9df3cd1f773be04e49804",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们希望有一个绝对闲适的环境，能够让我们的思维自由发展。",
      "output_sha256": "3974be32d86bd103fc32325301b3199200c50d14a722e43b1cd68ee92c08371f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.557492,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c05e908f805b179303d2d8de0948c02ae990e9584060cd3def394ab12e10249a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3974be32d86bd103fc32325301b3199200c50d14a722e43b1cd68ee92c08371f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "林玉堂先生在《现代评论》登过一篇文章谈他的教育的理想。",
      "output_sha256": "001506a83550add618a78443d97cc76101557b61ffed4c86b21023809742061d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "001506a83550add618a78443d97cc76101557b61ffed4c86b21023809742061d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "新近任叔永先生与他的夫人陈衡哲女士也发表了他们的教育的理想。",
      "output_sha256": "09474cc930e5a5936d42ee8926aeb806ec514f96a0cadbec788ac55e9ba19836",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "09474cc930e5a5936d42ee8926aeb806ec514f96a0cadbec788ac55e9ba19836",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "林先生的意思约莫记得是相仿效牛津一类学府；陈、任两位是要恢复书院制的精神。",
      "output_sha256": "d2eb86fa3ab1166ec786a6e6d369e02ead7716f78c5ed8df62d75dd50585bf35",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "d2eb86fa3ab1166ec786a6e6d369e02ead7716f78c5ed8df62d75dd50585bf35",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这两篇文章我认为是很重要的，尤其是陈、任两位的具体提议，但因为开倒车走回头路分明是不合时宜，他们几位的意思并不曾得到期望的回响。",
      "output_sha256": "3fdc700bc9f3bd1228d193980a313b73375c94df79dbbe3ffc88410d746e2955",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "3fdc700bc9f3bd1228d193980a313b73375c94df79dbbe3ffc88410d746e2955",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "想来现在的学者们太忙了，寻饭吃的、做官的，当革命领袖的，谁都不得闲，谁都不愿闲，结果当然没有人来关心什么纯粹教育（不含任何动机的学问）或是人格教育。",
      "output_sha256": "e7bc70b66c40c0c1d4d9019ad0b2aa2a9db49b491ee8f8ba664892656c9f9da7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "e7bc70b66c40c0c1d4d9019ad0b2aa2a9db49b491ee8f8ba664892656c9f9da7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这是个可憾的现象。",
      "output_sha256": "c786f0149651588066bed6cccdc891611006800f7e548eaef817c73934a30157",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "c786f0149651588066bed6cccdc891611006800f7e548eaef817c73934a30157",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我自己也是深受这种思乡病困扰的人；我只想要",
      "output_sha256": "0036d9f0730cc2bf35bf7efcb1f895c614a828871f014a6fcda23ca6d6bc2db6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.62,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b16cc6b6b7720d34e1eaac3572a55c5e9f0eff5055486ad0a90df0b72b9bce6a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0036d9f0730cc2bf35bf7efcb1f895c614a828871f014a6fcda23ca6d6bc2db6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "草青人远，一流冷涧……",
      "output_sha256": "c45427dc155e286a6bfd1aebde2e0838d471797cf97324d472df925e23c397d9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "c45427dc155e286a6bfd1aebde2e0838d471797cf97324d472df925e23c397d9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但我们这想望的境界有容我们达到的一天吗？",
      "output_sha256": "2fecf1fada20a96b902b81a1715389615b010c632c934e0cd4a554b63ba40790",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "2fecf1fada20a96b902b81a1715389615b010c632c934e0cd4a554b63ba40790",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
